{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Gu4fb348gHpMGcG3Az9nUo","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Lisenza Studio — Landing Page\n2\t\n3\t## Stack\n4\t- Astro 5 + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS v4\n5\t- Icons: astro-icon with lucide set (`<Icon name=\"lucide:icon-name\" />`)\n6\t- CSS config via @import \"tailwindcss\" + @theme block (Tailwind v4, no config file)\n7\t\n8\t## Conventions\n9\t- Components in src/components/ (Astro for static, React .tsx only for interactive)\n10\t- Content data in src/content/ as JSON — never hardcode copy in templates\n11\t- Theme tokens in src/styles/global.css @theme block — never hardcode hex colors\n12\t- Max 200 lines per file — split if needed\n13\t- Full-bleed sections, no margins between them, no border-radius on sections\n14\t- Use <Image> from astro:assets for optimized images\n15\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05E79F4F-0A3E-45E4-9EE6-1F04D5D200A4","uuid":"e62a39e0-a94e-4a5d-b213-61ae9121c983","timestamp":"2026-03-30T18:30:09.852Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/wilson/kwilaunch/projects/lisenza-studio/CLAUDE.md","content":"# Lisenza Studio — Landing Page\n\n## Stack\n- Astro 5 + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS v4\n- Icons: astro-icon with lucide set (`<Icon name=\"lucide:icon-name\" />`)\n- CSS config via @import \"tailwindcss\" + @theme block (Tailwind v4, no config file)\n\n## Conventions\n- Components in src/components/ (Astro for static, React .tsx only for interactive)\n- Content data in src/content/ as JSON — never hardcode copy in templates\n- Theme tokens in src/styles/global.css @theme block — never hardcode hex colors\n- Max 200 lines per file — split if needed\n- Full-bleed sections, no margins between them, no border-radius on sections\n- Use <Image> from astro:assets for optimized images\n","numLines":15,"startLine":1,"totalLines":15}}}
