o cada rincón con calidez y armonía.\",\n  \"products.items.2.description_en\": \"2oz reed diffuser in an elegant amber bottle. Releases continuous fragrance for 5 to 8 weeks, filling every corner with warmth and harmony.\",\n  \"products.items.2.size\": \"2oz · Incluye varillas difusoras · 5–8 semanas de duración\",\n  \"products.items.2.price\": \"RD$750\",\n  \"fragrances.items.0.name\": \"Lavanda & Ámbar\",\n  \"fragrances.items.0.description_es\": \"Ámbar egipcio y lavanda francesa en armonía: un aroma sofisticado, sereno y atemporal.\",\n  \"fragrances.items.0.description_en\": \"Egyptian amber and French lavender in harmony: a sophisticated, serene, and timeless scent.\",\n  \"fragrances.items.0.notes\": \"Lavanda francesa, ámbar egipcio, mirra negra, haba tonka, almizcle egipcio, salvia\",\n  \"fragrances.items.1.name\": \"Lino Blanco\",\n  \"fragrances.items.1.description_es\": \"Como un abrazo de telas recién lavadas, flores suaves y acordes de algodón para llenar tus días en frescura y ligereza cotidiana.\",\n  \"fragrances.items.1.description_en\": \"Like a warm embrace of freshly washed linens, soft florals, and cotton accords to fill your days with everyday freshness and lightness.\",\n  \"fragrances.items.1.notes\": \"Cítrico, Melocotón, Lirio, Jazmín, Rosa, Verde, Madera, Ámbar, Almizcle\",\n  \"fragrances.items.2.name\": \"Caoba & Coco\",\n  \"fragrances.items.2.description_es\": \"Caoba y coco en armonía, suavizados con sándalo y vainilla, realzados por un toque cítrico contemporáneo.\",\n  \"fragrances.items.2.description_en\": \"Mahogany and coconut in harmony, softened with sandalwood and vanilla, elevated by a contemporary citrus touch.\",\n  \"fragrances.items.2.notes\": \"Limón, Coco, Vainilla, Sándalo, Almizcle\",\n  \"fragrances.items.3.name\": \"Palo Santo & Pachulí\",\n  \"fragrances.items.3.description_es\": \"Sándalo y pachulí dulce, realzados por especias cálidas, en un aroma elegante y acogedor.\",\n  \"fragrances.items.3.description_en\": \"Sandalwood and sweet patchouli, elevated by warm spices, in an elegant and welcoming scent.\",\n  \"fragrances.items.3.notes\": \"Pimienta negra, clavo, nuez moscada, Lavanda, pachulí, vainilla, ámbar, sándalo, olíbano\",\n  \"fragrances.items.4.name\": \"Vainilla\",\n  \"fragrances.items.4.description_es\": \"Vainilla mantequillosa, maple dorado y coco tostado en una fragancia dulce y reconfortante.\",\n  \"fragrances.items.4.description_en\": \"Buttery vanilla, golden maple, and toasted coconut in a sweet and comforting fragrance.\",\n  \"fragrances.items.4.notes\": \"Mantequilla, Coco, Vainilla, Arce\",\n  \"fragrances.items.5.name\": \"Rocío & Té\",\n  \"fragrances.items.5.description_es\": \"Pepino, lima y flores suaves en una fragancia limpia, fresca y luminosa.\",\n  \"fragrances.items.5.description_en\": \"Cucumber, lime, and soft florals in a clean, fresh, and luminous fragrance.\",\n  \"fragrances.items.5.notes\": \"Naranja, Lima, Hojas verdes, Pepino, Rosa, Jazmín, Almizcle\",\n  \"fragrances.items.6.name\": \"Eucalipto & Menta\",\n  \"fragrances.items.6.description_es\": \"Menta verde y eucalipto en una fragancia fresca, herbal y energizante.\",\n  \"fragrances.items.6.description_en\": \"Spearmint and eucalyptus in a fresh, herbal, and energizing fragrance.\",\n  \"fragrances.items.6.notes\": \"Limón, Eucalipto, Menta verde, Almizcle\",\n  \"how_to_order.steps.0.title_es\": \"Confirmar disponibilidad\",\n  \"how_to_order.steps.0.title_en\": \"Confirm availability\",\n  \"how_to_order.steps.0.description_es\": \"Escríbenos por WhatsApp para confirmar disponibilidad, aroma y presentación.\",\n  \"how_to_order.steps.0.description_en\": \"Message us on WhatsApp to confirm availability, scent, and product type.\",\n  \"how_to_order.steps.1.title_es\": \"Realizar pago\",\n  \"how_to_order.steps.1.title_en\": \"Make your payment\",\n  \"how_to_order.steps.1.description_es\": \"Confirma tu orden realizando el pago vía transferencia (Banco BHD o Banco Popular).\",\n  \"how_to_order.steps.1.description_en\": \"Confirm your order by completing payment via bank transfer (Banco BHD or Banco Popular).\",\n  \"how_to_order.steps.2.title_es\": \"Coordinar envío\",\n  \"how_to_order.steps.2.title_en\": \"Arrange delivery\",\n  \"how_to_order.steps.2.description_es\": \"Completa tus datos de envío. El delivery tiene un costo adicional desde RD$250.\",\n  \"how_to_order.steps.2.description_en\": \"Share your shipping details. Delivery has an additional cost starting at RD$250.\",\n  \"about.heading_es\": \"Nuestra Historia\",\n  \"about.heading_en\": \"Our Story\",\n  \"about.story_es\": \"Lisenza Studio nació de la pasión por transformar espacios cotidianos en experiencias sensoriales. Cada producto es elaborado artesanalmente en República Dominicana con cera de soya 100% natural y fragancias cuidadosamente seleccionadas. Creemos que un buen aroma tiene el poder de cambiar tu día — desde el primer momento que enciendes una vela hasta la última nota que permanece en tu habitación. Nuestro compromiso es ofrecer productos puros, elegantes y accesibles que llenen tu hogar de calidez y armonía.\",\n  \"about.story_en\": \"Lisenza Studio was born from a passion for transforming everyday spaces into sensory experiences. Every product is handcrafted in the Dominican Republic using 100% natural soy wax and carefully curated fragrances. We believe a good scent has the power to change your day — from the first moment you light a candle to the last note that lingers in your room. Our commitment is to offer pure, elegant, and accessible products that fill your home with warmth and harmony.\",\n  \"good_to_know.items.0.title_es\": \"¿No sabes qué aroma elegir?\",\n  \"good_to_know.items.0.title_en\": \"Not sure which scent to choose?\",\n  \"good_to_know.items.0.description_es\": \"Solicita nuestro kit de mini muestras gratuitas y descubre tu fragancia favorita. Solo pagas el costo de envío hasta tu ubicación.\",\n  \"good_to_know.items.0.description_en\": \"Request our free mini sample kit and discover your favorite fragrance. You only pay the shipping cost to your location.\",\n  \"good_to_know.items.1.title_es\": \"¿Regalos?\",\n  \"good_to_know.items.1.title_en\": \"Gifts?\",\n  \"good_to_know.items.1.description_es\": \"¿Tu orden es para obsequiar? Incluimos empaque de regalo sin costo adicional en tu orden.\",\n  \"good_to_know.items.1.description_en\": \"Is your order a gift? We include gift wrapping at no extra cost with your order.\",\n  \"good_to_know.items.2.title_es\": \"Facturación\",\n  \"good_to_know.items.2.title_en\": \"Invoicing\",\n  \"good_to_know.items.2.description_es\": \"Si deseas recibir tu factura con comprobante fiscal (NCF), notifícalo al momento de ordenar.\",\n  \"good_to_know.items.2.description_en\": \"If you need an invoice with a tax receipt (NCF), let us know when placing your order.\",\n  \"good_to_know.items.3.title_es\": \"Personalización\",\n  \"good_to_know.items.3.title_en\": \"Customization\",\n  \"good_to_know.items.3.description_es\": \"Si deseas adquirir productos personalizados con tu marca o para eventos especiales, contáctanos.\",\n  \"good_to_know.items.3.description_en\": \"Looking for custom-branded products or special event orders? Contact us.\"\n}\n","numLines":87,"startLine":1,"totalLines":87}}}
